name: sim.setJointDependency
description: Sets a joint dependent of another joint. The dependent joint should first be set into dependent mode via sim.setJointMode
luaSynopsis: sim.setJointDependency(int jointHandle, int masterJointHandle, float offset, float multCoeff)
pythonSynopsis: sim.setJointDependency(int jointHandle, int masterJointHandle, float offset, float multCoeff)
inputs:
1. jointHandle: handle of the joint to become slave
2. masterJointHandle: handle of the joint to become master, or -1 to free the slave joint from dependency
3. offset: offset in equation slave = offset + master * multCoeff
4. multCoeff: coeff in equation slave = offset + master * multCoeff
outputs:
replacedBy:
- name: dependencyMaster, class: joint, file: joint_dependencyMaster.property
- name: dependencyParams, class: joint, file: joint_dependencyParams.property
